---
const rows=[['Compute, memory and I/O allowance',180,360],['Storage, backup and transfer allowance',80,100],['Operator time at £80/hour',960,320]];
---
<figure class="selection-cost" data-selection-cost>
 <figcaption><span>Figure 2</span> Cheap infrastructure can buy expensive work</figcaption>
 <p class="note">Invented monthly planning allowances in pounds, before tax. These are not supplier prices or equivalent service guarantees.</p>
 <label for="a08-hours">Self-managed operator hours each month <output data-hours for="a08-hours">12</output></label>
 <input id="a08-hours" data-hours-input type="range" min="0" max="30" step="1" value="12" />
 <div class="comparison"><div><p>Self-managed server</p><strong data-self-total>£1,220/month</strong><dl>{rows.map(([label,self])=><div><dt>{label}</dt><dd data-labour={String(label).startsWith('Operator') ? '' : undefined}>£{self}</dd></div>)}</dl></div><div><p>Managed server</p><strong>£780/month</strong><dl>{rows.map(([label,,managed])=><div><dt>{label}</dt><dd>£{managed}</dd></div>)}</dl></div></div>
 <p data-conclusion aria-live="polite">At 12 versus 4 operator hours, the managed allowance is £440 lower. The recovery and service gates still need to pass.</p>
 <details><summary>Read the calculation</summary><p>Self-managed = £180 + £80 + hours × £80. Managed = £360 + £100 + 4 × £80 = £780. At 6.5 self-managed hours the totals are equal. The hours include monitoring, maintenance, restore rehearsals and incident work. Replace every allowance with a dated quote and your own effort estimate.</p></details>
</figure>
<script>
 document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-selection-cost]').forEach(root=>{
  const input=root.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[data-hours-input]')!;
  input.addEventListener('input',()=>{const hours=Number(input.value),total=260+80*hours,diff=total-780;
   root.querySelector('[data-hours]')!.textContent=String(hours);root.querySelector('[data-labour]')!.textContent=`£${hours*80}`;root.querySelector('[data-self-total]')!.textContent=`£${total.toLocaleString('en-GB')}/month`;
   root.querySelector('[data-conclusion]')!.textContent=`At ${hours} versus 4 operator hours, ${diff===0?'the allowances are equal':diff>0?`the managed allowance is £${diff} lower`:`the self-managed allowance is £${-diff} lower`}. The recovery and service gates still need to pass.`;
  });
 });
</script>
<style>
 .selection-cost{border:1px solid var(--color-rule);background:var(--color-surface);padding:1rem;margin:2rem 0}figcaption{font-weight:650}figcaption span{display:block;font-size:.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}.note{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)}label{display:block;font-size:.9rem}label output{font-weight:700;padding-left:.5rem}input{width:100%;min-height:44px;accent-color:var(--color-text)}input:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--color-text);outline-offset:3px}.comparison{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.75rem;margin:1rem 0}.comparison>div{border:1px solid var(--color-rule);padding:.75rem;min-width:0}.comparison p{font-size:.9rem;margin:0 0 .5rem}.comparison strong{font-size:1.1rem}dl{font-size:.8rem}dl div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule);padding:.5rem 0}dd{margin:0}details{font-size:.85rem}summary{cursor:pointer;min-height:44px}@media(max-width:540px){.comparison{grid-template-columns:1fr}.selection-cost{padding:.75rem}}
</style>
